SPEC = {'setting': 'Warm Miyazaki-inspired hand-painted Japanese animation food illustration. Honey wood and ivory ceramics. Soft cel shading, no photorealism, no diagrams, no text. No hands.', 'steps': ['A wooden board with peeled raw potato batons exactly 18 mm square, 8–10 cm long. Beside it a single transparent heat-rated cooking pouch containing a neat one-layer row of the same thick potato batons submerged in clear brine, open top clipped upright, no spills. Small clear pitcher of prepared brine beside bag.', 'A clear sous-vide bath with a slim black immersion circulator and one transparent heat-rated pouch. Inside pouch, thick pale potato batons 18 mm square in ONE layer fully immersed in clear brine; pouch mouth clipped upright above water, potatoes completely below water surface. No readable numbers, no oil, no frying bubbles, no hands.', 'First low-temperature fry: tall stainless pot less than half filled with clear hot oil on a modest burner. A mesh spider lifts three very PALE 18 mm thick potato batons just above the oil; pale unbrowned but set crust. Handle exits frame, no hand. Wire rack above a tray alongside holds a few dry cooked potato batons. No golden finished fries.', 'Inside an open domestic freezer drawer, a small metal tray and wire rack with separate PALE par-fried thick potato batons 18 mm square, laid out without touching. Slight surface frost, not heavy snow. No bag yet, no hands, no oil, no golden fries.', 'Finished thick-cut fries in an ivory shallow bowl on honey wood: each baton 18 mm thick, crisp golden irregular crust, one broken open showing fluffy white potato interior. Small dish of ketchup beside, no garnish. No shoestring fries, no oil puddle, no hands.'], 'hero': 'Finished thick-cut fries in an ivory shallow bowl on honey wood: each baton 18 mm thick, crisp golden irregular crust, one broken open showing fluffy white potato interior. Small dish of ketchup beside, no garnish. No shoestring fries, no oil puddle, no hands.', 'mise': []}
